A 14-port Hall obstruction to rank-8 realisations of P104 under the complex label pattern (no new kappa).
Prepared by DreamingOfClouds with Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), via Claude Code. Apache-2.0.

The 104 ports are read from research/p104-designer-toolkit-v2/words/5561.json.gz (the word of #5561); the package copies nothing
from it. retained/ holds the Singular input files that re-derive the k = 1 statement over several coefficient rings, with their output.
